**Extracting Text from a Document using JavaScript**
=====================================================

In this example, we'll create a JavaScript function that extracts the text from a document. This function will work with HTML documents and will remove all HTML tags, leaving only the text content.

**Function Implementation**
---------------------------

```javascript
/**
 * Extracts the text from a document.
 *
 * @param {Document} document The document object to extract text from.
 * @returns {string} The extracted text.
 */
function extractTextFromDocument(document) {
    // Check if the document is valid
    if (!document || !document.documentElement) {
        throw new Error("Invalid document object");
    }

    // Remove all script and style elements
    const scriptElements = document.querySelectorAll('script, style');
    scriptElements.forEach(element => element.remove());

    // Get the text content of the document
    const text = document.documentElement.textContent;

    // Return the extracted text
    return text.trim();
}
```

**Usage Example**
-----------------

```javascript
// Get the current document object
const documentObject = document;

// Extract the text from the document
const extractedText = extractTextFromDocument(documentObject);

// Log the extracted text to the console
console.log(extractedText);
```

**Alternative Implementation using DOMParser**
---------------------------------------------

If you want to extract text from an HTML string instead of a document object, you can use the `DOMParser` API.

```javascript
/**
 * Extracts the text from an HTML string.
 *
 * @param {string} htmlString The HTML string to extract text from.
 * @returns {string} The extracted text.
 */
function extractTextFromHTML(htmlString) {
    // Create a new DOMParser object
    const parser = new DOMParser();

    // Parse the HTML string into a document object
    const documentObject = parser.parseFromString(htmlString, "text/html");

    // Extract the text from the document object
    return extractTextFromDocument(documentObject);
}
```

**Usage Example**
-----------------

```javascript
// Define an HTML string
const htmlString = "<html><body>This is a <span>test</span> page.</body></html>";

// Extract the text from the HTML string
const extractedText = extractTextFromHTML(htmlString);

// Log the extracted text to the console
