Creating a full-fledged sprite editor in JavaScript would be quite extensive and beyond the scope of this platform. However, I can provide you with a simple example to get started. This code will allow you to create a canvas and draw on it using mouse events. You can consider it as a basic building block for a sprite editor:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
